OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings including a live
OL,13,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall with
OL,14,     Gcellist Alisa Weilerstein and
OL,15,     Gpianist Pavel Kolesnikov.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Franz Xaver
OL,17,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,18,     GDonald Macleod takes a tour of
OL,19,     Gthe early life of Franz Xaver
OL,20,     GMozart, including the complicated
OL,21,     Grelationship with his mother,
OL,22,     GConstanze.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
