OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GLive music from the Piatti
OL,6,     GQuartet.
OL,7,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,8,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,9,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,10,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,11,     GThe Ukranian pianist Vadym
OL,12,     GKholodenko performs works by
OL,13,     GBeethoven, Lyatoshinsky, and
OL,14,     GLiszt in concert at Wigmore Hall
OL,15,     Gin London.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,17,     GRachel Cooke looks at the
OL,18,     Gdisappointments of the creative
OL,19,     Glife. Creative disappointment,
OL,20,     Gwhich often follows years of
OL,21,     Gsolitary work, is, she feels, one
OL,22,     Gof the worst kinds.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
